Subject: [PATCH v13 8/8] jails/instances/lab-mail: Sync the Next and Later
 folders
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: xlunvnzsqsvlpvpmzoomywrowwpymvzx
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:55:09 +0000

Pat triages the list in three steps, not two: a message is either
done, needs work soon, or can wait. INBOX and Archive alone cannot
hold that middle state anywhere every client and agent sees it.

- lab-mail syncs Next and Later beside INBOX and Archive, and mbsync
  creates them on lab-mail. The operator creates them once on
  Fastmail.
